<title>USA: CBOE, AMEX to list Telefonica del Peru options.</title>
<headline>CBOE, AMEX to list Telefonica del Peru options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) and the American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Wednesday they would list options on American Depositary Receipts of Telefonica del Peru SA on October 9.</p>
<p>In separate statements, the exchanges said opening strike prices on Telefonica options would be 20, 22-1/2 and 25. The ADRs were up 5/8 at 21 Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>Initial expiration months will be November, December, January and April, the exchanges said.  </p>
<p>On the CBOE, the options will trade in the Citicorp trading crowd.  Cohen, Duffy &amp; McGowan Inc will be the specialist unit at the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Telefonica del Peru is based in Lima and offers fixed local, domestic and international telephone services as well as other telecommunications services.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
